{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有，Y在S02用‘第一次还信自己没事，第二次努力相信’写出了自我劝说逐渐失效的细微变化，X少了这层心理细节。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X把关键字放大加亮，话和感受交替排列，部分感受还随音乐到时出现，让我能边听边抓住每次情绪转折；Y虽然有不少好细节，但左右同时摆出的短词太多，尤其S03和S06，很难及时判断哪些重要、哪些对应眼前的情节。X把舍不得、想起委屈、害怕孤单、不敢回去直到带着想念继续生活的因果关系讲得更清楚，前后的反复也像同一个人在慢慢变化。它的细腻不仅来自形容词，还来自具体声音、身体反应与心理矛盾的对应，因此更容易让我实际感受到，而不是只看见一堆情绪名称。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5d760a41-2834-4ad6-96d3-87d7d3f46283", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T031004482781Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:10:38.334994+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "daf7d64a4abc96532eb388c3ac7ffec0dbe95e06c716082e63c8aa0f7a3a7009", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700